        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_brother_07",
      "hash64": "2C5EDAF8ACDFEEE0",
      "text": "Pues he vuelto a perder.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_brother_08",
      "hash64": "2C5EE9F8ACE0085D",
      "text": "Y todo por lo de siempre... Porque soy un\\ndebilucho.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_brother_09",
      "hash64": "2C5EE8F8ACE006AA",
      "text": "En fin, leamos el cartel y acabemos con el tema.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_system_01",
      "hash64": "E9094D2B1A6E9F13",
      "text": "Si al crepúsculo y fuera de la aldea adviertes una\\nsilueta que se aproxima, avanza con gran cautela.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_system_02",
      "hash64": "E9094E2B1A6EA0C6",
      "text": "Oculta la faz al instante tras una máscara,\\ny mantenla puesta hasta que el peligro cese.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_system_03",
      "hash64": "E9094F2B1A6EA279",
      "text": "De esta forma, la silueta, fuere humano u ogro,\\nte saludará como a un igual y pasará de largo.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_system_04",
      "hash64": "E909502B1A6EA42C",
      "text": "Si no traes contigo una máscara, quiera la suerte\\nque la misteriosa figura frente a ti sea humana.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_system_05",
      "hash64": "E909512B1A6EA5DF",
      "text": "Pues así vivirás para aprender la lección, y jamás\\nvolverás a salir de tu hogar sin llevarla.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_system_06",
      "hash64": "E909522B1A6EA792",
      "text": "Desdichado aquel que se halle frente a frente\\ncon el ogro y le deje ver su verdadero rostro.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_system_07",
      "hash64": "E909532B1A6EA945",
      "text": "El precio a pagar será ver su alma arrebatada y\\nnunca más poder regresar a su hogar.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_brother_18",
      "hash64": "2C5B63F8ACDCEED4",
      "text": "Antes, la gente de la villa no salía nunca de\\ncasa sin su máscara.\\c\\nY, por lo visto, el encargado de fabricarlas era\\nel tatarabuelo de mi tatarabuelo... o algo así.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 166,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_brother_19",
      "hash64": "2C5B64F8ACDCF087",
      "text": "¡Qué fuerte!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_brother_20",
      "hash64": "2C656DF8ACE55457",
      "text": "¿De verdad?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_brother_21",
      "hash64": "2C656CF8ACE552A4",
      "text": "Evidentemente, lo de que el ogro iba robando\\nalmas por ahí es mentira, pero que el fabricante\\r\\nde máscaras era antepasado mío sí es verdad.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_brother_22",
      "hash64": "2C656FF8ACE557BD",
      "text": "La nuestra ha sido una familia de fabricantes de\\nmáscaras desde hace unas cuantas generaciones.\\c\\nTendrías que ver la maña que tiene para estas\\ncosas el abuelo.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 161,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_brother_23",
      "hash64": "2C656EF8ACE5560A",
      "text": "Hasta el Festival de Máscaras fue idea de algún\\nantepasado mío, según he oído.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_brother_10",
      "hash64": "2C5B5BF8ACDCE13C",
      "text": "...\\c\\nNo me gusta lo que pone en este cartel.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_brother_24",
      "hash64": "2C6569F8ACE54D8B",
      "text": "Vale que el ogro diera un poco de miedo, pero\\nde ahí a exagerarlo todo e inventarse mentiras...\\c\\n¿Qué pasa? ¿Así justificaban lo de marginarlo\\ny echarlo de la aldea? ¡Pues no, no es justo![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 190,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_brother_11",
      "hash64": "2C5B5CF8ACDCE2EF",
      "text": "¿Tú cómo crees que se sentiría él? ¡Pues fatal![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_brother_25",
      "hash64": "2C6568F8ACE54BD8",
      "text": "Solo y abandonado... Excluido...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_select_05",
      "hash64": "08A96901DBB56C8C",
      "text": "Tienes razón",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_select_06",
      "hash64": "08A96C01DBB571A5",
      "text": "Lo siento...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_brother_12",
      "hash64": "2C5B5DF8ACDCE4A2",
      "text": "Veo que nos entendemos, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_brother_13",
      "hash64": "2C5B5EF8ACDCE655",
      "text": "¿Por? ¿Has hecho algo?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_brother_14",
      "hash64": "2C5B57F8ACDCDA70",
      "text": "Bueno, qué, ¿nos hacemos la última foto?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_brother_15",
      "hash64": "2C5B58F8ACDCDC23",
      "text": "Pues ya hemos terminado la actividad.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_030_brother_16",
      "hash64": "2C5B59F8ACDCDDD6",
      "text": "Pienso seguir entrenando con mis Pokémon\\npara hacerme más fuerte...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
